[[Harn Coldstone]] is an [[Enchanted armor|Enchanted]] [[boss]] that appears in [[Perdition Rock]].

== Locations ==
* [[Ring of Fire Island Chain]]
** {{NPC location|Perdition Rock}}

== Quests ==
* [[Harn and Maxine Coldstone (Zaishen quest)]]

== Skills ==
* {{skill icon|Armor of Frost}}
* {{skill icon|Aura of Restoration}}
* {{skill icon|Crystal Wave}}
* {{skill icon|Glyph of Lesser Energy}}
* {{skill icon|Obsidian Flesh}} ([[elite]])
* {{skill icon|Rust}}
* {{skill icon|Shard Storm}}

== Notes ==
* Once a player gets in [[radar]] range of his location, Harn Coldstone will [[spawn]] and begin his [[patrol]] around the island. He moves through many enemy mobs, which can make catching up with him complicated; be careful to not [[aggro]] too many enemies accidentally. See [[Harn and Maxine Coldstone (Zaishen quest)]] for additional strategies.
* He shares his spawn point with [[Maxine Coldstone]], so only one of them can be present at one time. If you see Maxine, then Harn won't be on the map, and vice-versa.
* Harn is ''less'' likely to spawn than Maxine.
* He is the only [[Enchanted_armor|Enchanted]] boss without the word ''Custodian'' in his name, and who is not located in the [[Crystal Desert]].
*Unlike other Elementalists, he [[attack]]s at [[melee range]].
{{Anomaly|Unlike most [[Enchanted]], this boss is considered [[fleshy]].}}
